		Heading 1:
			Text: Trim margins
		Paragraph: Each card has a padding of 8 and two texts with a margin of 12 above and below. `Trim margins` drops the margin of the first child (`top`), of the last one (`bottom`) or both. The margin between the two texts never changes.
			Style: intro
		Text: Trim margins: none (by default)
